  "post_content": "<p>El Pabell&oacute;n Municipal de Onda ha acogido a mediod&iacute;a de este domingo&nbsp;la X edici&oacute;n del&nbsp;partido amistoso de f&uacute;tbol sala entre el nutrido equipo del Centro Ocupacional El Mol&iacute; y un mermado Esports Lizondo.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/DSC_0007.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 319px\" /></p>\n<p>El &aacute;rbitro ha sido Roberto, quiz&aacute;s un poco parcial a favor del Mol&iacute;, pero eso no na restado m&eacute;rito a la contundente victoria de los campeones de Espa&ntilde;a por 24-18.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsalaamistoscoelmoliesportslizondo13/dsc_0005.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsalaamistoscoelmoliesportslizondo13/dsc_0007.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0007\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsalaamistoscoelmoliesportslizondo13/dsc_0009.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0009\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsalaamistoscoelmoliesportslizondo13/dsc_0012.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0012\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsalaamistoscoelmoliesportslizondo13/dsc_0013.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0013\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsalaamistoscoelmoliesportslizondo13/dsc_0014.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsalaamistoscoelmoliesportslizondo13/dsc_0015.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439ef